while we waited on our friends to head to Bourbon, ended up spending about 6 hours here. The bartenders were excellent and made us authentic New Orleans favorites like a Hurricane and Pimms Cup, not the sugary drinks you get on Bourbon. We also sampled some local beers as well. After ordering my first drink, the bartended pla..."},{"business_id":"F-2iFmJ-f5vCNKh1s59N8Q","review_id":"Ehrm7NFEvQwXiMsYVzeJQw","date":"2018-06-26T03:42:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9104300737380981,"text_excerpt":"Rachel was so welcoming and accomodating. Although i was only waiting for a friend, she kept me company and made sure i had water. Ive been in \"the business\" since 89. Promote her ahead of her peers."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"F-2iFmJ-f5vCNKh1s59N8Q","photo_id":"2m7_HxBWI8PbKHkuXk05AA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2m7_HxBWI8PbKHkuXk05AA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
